            "displayName": "Paul Lindner",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "America/Los_Angeles"
          },
          "body": "Works in heavy production load.\n\nThere's a new behavior that results in a ConcurrentModificationException that I'll detail in a new bug.\n",
